                  "blocks": {
                    "text_GDpp6V": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<p>Jose Balli created the Original Metal Pocket Square™ as a new take on the classic fabric pocket square.</p><p>Each design is sculpted in solid metal and made to sit in your jacket pocket. No fabric. No folding. Just an original finishing touch made to be remembered.</p>",
